\tab /V\tab When the '/V' command-line option switch is set, certain \tab\tab\tab messages may be embellished to provide additional program \tab\tab\tab management guidance; certain console messages may be \tab\tab\tab\tab enhanced to provide additional information.  [Note: This is \tab\tab known as verbose operating mode.]  This option switch is \tab\tab\tab ignored if the '/S' [silent running mode] is set.\par
